        <h3>What is 100°F in Celsius?</h3>
        <p>100°F = 37.78°C. Calculated as (100 - 32) × 5/9 = 37.78°C. Normal body temperature is 98.6°F = 37°C.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What is 72°F in Celsius?</h3>
        <p>72°F = 22.22°C. Comfortable room temperature range is 68–77°F (20–25°C).</p>
